ancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortification\" title=\"Fortification\">Fortification</a> Bypass. (Fortification Bypass makes your attacks ignore a percentage of enemy Fortification.)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Viktranium_Experiment_crafting\" title=\"Viktranium Experiment crafting\"><span style=\"background-color: #9AFEFF\">Lamordia: Melancholic Slot (Accessory)</span></a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Viktranium_Experiment_crafting\" title=\"Viktranium Experiment crafting\">Lamordia: Melancholic Slot (Accessory)</a>:</b><br />Apply a Lamordia augment to this item.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Viktranium_Experiment_crafting\" title=\"Viktranium Experiment crafting\"><span style=\"background-color: #9AFEFF\">Lamordia: Dolorous Slot (Accessory)</span></a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Viktranium_Experiment_crafting\" title=\"Viktranium Experiment crafting\">Lamordia: Dolorous Slot (Accessory)</a>:</b><br />Apply a Lamordia augment to this item.</span></span></li>\n<li><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705465\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.augment.orange>span.title,.mw-parser-output